title: The builder folds in the readings, not the plan's author or Top.
pid: 703d56df-693f-4f97-8855-1f207bdbd97f
body: |2-
  In Google's and Oxide's practice the author folds in feedback. Here
  that is a further mission, and Top's words cost most. The first
  builder is usually the author's own specialist, reading the same graph.
